OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to reroute coastal path amid
OL,4,Acliff erosion risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to re-route a cliff path along a
OL,7,Fsea wall amid sea damage and erosion
OL,8,Frisk are progressing, a senior
OL,9,Fpolitician has said.
OL,11,FGuernsey's Environment and
OL,12,FInfrastructure Committee (E&I)
OL,13,FPresident Adrian Gabriel said staff had
OL,14,Fbeen "in consultation" with landowners
OL,15,Faround the Fermain wall for two years
OL,16,Fin the lead-up to the publication of a
OL,17,Fnew work plan.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
