OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to reroute coastal path amid
OL,4,Acliff erosion risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the sea wall - a costal feature
OL,7,Fwhich stops the cliff falling into the
OL,8,Fsea, which was subject to a sea breach
OL,9,Fa decade ago - was at risk of becoming
OL,10,F"impassable".
OL,12,FGabriel added there was "nothing to be
OL,13,Fimmediately worried about", maintaining
OL,14,Fthe path was still accessible.
